{"v":4,"catch":"滑板＆塗鴉動作遊戲！","desc":"《Ink Splash》是一款2D動作遊戲。\n一邊踩著滑板，一邊用墨水塗滿地面，並在牆上繪製塗鴉吧。\n\n在計時對戰模式中，得分較高的一方即可獲勝。\n隨著關卡推進，將會解鎖各種不同的技巧。\n運用多樣化的招式，在塗鴉對戰中取得勝利吧。","publisher":"HUNTERS","release":"2026-08-06","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/300564042bebf2eaa564e41b069bbc6df241ed58ed4d638d433d696f0831b947.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/585cfd4d60392805cfaf990792b7cdc5342f0d0327c3096456920cbeaa533711.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d9b51a64c00d430e78e4e2150a13bfc414fc4fa2ae8f619eda912e30b2c5bd7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/60530cdcc891b755b65f983e11caf23bfb3fc47f9fa00b2f15bb9e3b33e55edc.jpg"],"titleId":"010032602870c000","dlc":[]}